{
  "_doc": "Tier-3 pool building (random towns, industrial lots): a lumber yard and feed store with a timber shed two storeys high, open to its rafters, and a grain leg climbing beside a feed bin. Route: the store door is padlocked and the shed's big doors chained -> round through the lumber yard (the forklift, the stacks, jaws in the dirt) -> the shed's back doors stand open with cans strung across them (their rattle wakes the shed: ambush) -> the ladder up to the catwalk (rotten boards past the tool crate drop you back to the floor) -> the feed loft (opening its door wakes the two in the sacks) -> the mix loft -> the leg landing and the ladder up the grain leg to the head house: Walt, his note and the office key -> back down the leg -> the mixing room -> Walt's office: the door is wired to his shotgun, Eli is inside (loot, guardian) -> out through the office's bolted yard door. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
